  "body": "Positioned in one of North Shore's most sought-after coastal locations, this substantial freehold residence offers an exceptional lifestyle just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nSpanning approximately 430sqm, this impressive three-level, solid concrete and weatherboard home has been thoughtfully designed to maximise its breathtaking sea views, generous proportions and effortless indoor-outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe upper level is dedicated to expansive open-plan living, dining and a well-appointed kitchen, all perfectly positioned to capture stunning ocean vistas stretching across the Hauraki Gulf. The home provides flexibility for families of all ages, while five generous bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms offer space and privacy for everyone.\r\n\r\nDesigned for both relaxation and entertaining, the home features a swimming pool, spa, sauna, expansive decking and several balconies where you can unwind while enjoying the ever-changing coastal outlook.\r\n\r\nThe lifestyle on offer is truly outstanding. Take a short stroll to beautiful Castor Bay Beach for a morning swim, explore the walking tracks and breathtaking clifftop views at Kennedy Park and enjoy the convenience of a local café just down the road. Public transport is nearby, while the vibrant villages of Mairangi Bay and Milford, with their boutique shopping, cafés, restaurants, beaches and amenities, are only minutes away.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure an exceptional coastal sanctuary where space, views and lifestyle come together in perfect harmony.",
